Spiritual Healing Return Mana
    Events
        Unit - A unit Starts the effect of an ability
    Conditions
        (Level of RESTORATION_SpiritualHealing  for (Triggering unit)) Greater than or equal to 1
        Or - Any (Conditions) are true
            Conditions
                (Ability being cast) Equal to RESTORATION_ChainHeal 
                (Ability being cast) Equal to RESTORATION_HealingRain 
                (Ability being cast) Equal to RESTORATION_HealingWave 
                (Ability being cast) Equal to RESTORATION_Rejuvenation 
    Actions
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                (Ability being cast) Equal to RESTORATION_ChainHeal 
            Then - Actions
                Set VariableSet HealManaCost = (For (Triggering unit), Mana cost of RESTORATION_ChainHeal , Level (Level of RESTORATION_ChainHeal  for (Triggering unit)).)
                Wait 0.05 seconds
                Unit - Set mana of (Triggering unit) to ((Mana of (Triggering unit)) + ((Real((Intelligence of (Triggering unit) (Include bonuses)))) x ((Real(HealManaCost)) / 100.00)))
            Else - Actions
